#: qps.C:623
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You do not have permission to view the\n"
"open sockets of process %d (%s).\n"
"Only the owner of the process and the\n"
"super-user may do that."
msgstr ""
"您无权查看\n"
"进程 %d (%s) 打开的套接字。\n"
"只有进程所有者和\n"
"超级用户可以这样做。"

#: qps.C:628 qps.C:837 qps.C:879 qps.C:885 qps.C:908 qps.C:944 qps.C:988
